# Dark Whelpling from the black whelps of Dustwallow Marsh and the Badlands.
# Sources: items.json and the TDB's loot (Searing / Scalding Whelp, 0.11% per
# kill; Classic drop data); npcs.json (spawns, levels); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70532 (the client's name; it can be traded).

step Black whelps
  tip The Searing Whelps of the Wyrmbog in southern Dustwallow Marsh (level 42-43) and the Scalding Whelps of eastern Badlands (level 41-43) drop it about once in 900 kills. The waypoint is the Wyrmbog, where the whelps stand thickest; the Badlands whelps are the same grind. The whelpling can be traded, so the Auction House may be quicker.
  collect 10822 "Dark Whelpling" @46.9,72.5 -- The Wyrmbog
